  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Financial Inclusion Facility (WFIF) -  PP PA Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the WEE action is to address key constraints to women&apos;s financial inclusion and economic empowerment in Sub-Saharan Africa. The action recognizes that support to women&apos;s entrepreunership and improved economic agency is essential drivers for scaling private sector development and promoting gender equality. As such, the WEE action is expected to both contribute to various Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) of Agenda 2030, namely SDGs 1, 5 and 8, and GAP II.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
